      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>To our lord, the blessings of God be upon him, belongs the lofty resolution concerning that, if God wills.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Praise be to God alone, God bless our lord Mu\u1e25ammmad and his family,and save them.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My sufficiency is God. How excellent a keeper is he!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The slave of our lord and master, the im\u0101m al-Mustan\u1e63ir bi-All\u0101h, commander ofthe faithful ...</p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
